  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing sexual reproductive health &amp; menstrual hygiene for women &amp; girls in rural schools &amp; communities in Namibia.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eliminate period poverty by addressing the need to educate young women and girls on sexual reproductive health and their menstrual hygiene through the provision of biodegradable pads, sanitary products and direct outreach to affected rural communities across Namibia.</narrative>
  </description>
